note Canonical ustar: header bytes, numeric fields, checksum, sorted distinct safe paths; two zero
note blocks, regular files only, no links/devices/extensions. Validate the entire archive before
note making any file in the scratch work tree. Pass two writes only paths validated by pass one.
fn uoct a ulong n ulong to long
v = long 0
for i ulong sub n 1 bound 12
c = get uhdr add a i
if or lt c 48 gt c 55
ret -1
end
v = add mul v 8 long sub c 48
end
if ne get uhdr sub add a n 1 0
ret -1
end
ret v
end
fn uzero a ulong n ulong to bool
for i ulong n bound 512
if ne get uhdr add a i 0
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
fn ustr a ulong n ulong to ulong
for i ulong n bound 512
if eq get uhdr add a i 0
if not uzero add add a i 1 sub sub n i 1
put uerr 0 1
end
ret i
end
end
ret n
end
fn upathto a ulong n ulong k ulong to ulong
for i ulong n bound 255
put uname add k i get uhdr add a i
