note uinitrad: rad init of the scratch git dir as the node's user; the RID is read from the
note "rad:z..." in its output. Description: the bring note, else a fixed sentence.
fn uinitrad to bool
pkrad
pkt kuinit
pkt kupub
pkt kunocon
